title: "Benchmark26: QPU runtime estimator benchmark"
abstract: "Code and aggregate results for comparing neural, regression and analytical QPU runtime estimators on 3,443 archived observations in 203 logical-circuit groups from the Ma-Li, Qonductor and QPack sources."
